/-! Dimension 24 from the sharp lower Gaussian profile alone.

Generated by a script from the theorems of the library whose statement has the hypothesis
`(hG24 : ∀ β : ℝ, 0 < β → ∃ f, LeechGaussianContactCertificate24 β f)`.  Those theorems use the
certificates only to obtain the sharp lower Gaussian profile `SphereGaussianSharpProfileLower24`
of `S²⁴`.  Here each of them is restated with that profile as its hypothesis (`…_of_profile`);
the proofs are the same text.  The hypothesis asks for a certificate at every scale `β > 0`; the
profile needs certificates only at the scales `β ≠ 1`, which is what the kernel inequalities of
the Leech lattice supply. -/

